{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured persistent rsyslog forwarding of node2 messages tagged `inventory` to node1 over TCP/514. Messages are stored at `/var/log/inventory/node2.log`. Delivery and data persistence were verified after sequential restarts of both nodes.","actions_performed":["Configured node1 as the selective inventory log collector and persistently opened TCP/514.","Configured node2 with selective forwarding, indefinite retries, and a persistent disk queue.","Validated both rsyslog configurations and confirmed live message delivery.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually, verifying changed boot identities and full recovery.","Confirmed RHEL 9.8 and the installed kernel remained unchanged."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"node1 collector configuration and persistent storage","command_ids":["cmd-e8f3a02394384ad2","cmd-4ee22fec37bb41f5","cmd-d748369a9a274746"],"summary":"Collector configuration validated; TCP/514 is allowed and listening; the baseline inventory message was stored at the required path."},{"requirement":"node2 persistent inventory forwarding","command_ids":["cmd-e4147be41b084985","cmd-35c545fe68984f84","cmd-ab764d7291084ba0"],"summary":"Selective forwarding with persistent retry queue is configured; rsyslog is enabled and active; the TCP connection and source message were observed."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-d748369a9a274746","cmd-e559958b905f44c0","cmd-7f1400371f42464d","cmd-41f3bdcc9ec441c1","cmd-c5738991782541ad"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and boot ID, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, restored listener/firewall/data, and fresh post-restart delivery were proven."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-5631537b2c6841bb","cmd-7fdafee54bbd46a5","cmd-f752c185d9c14878","cmd-bc53ffebfe284444","cmd-e8651df23d2a406a"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and boot ID, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, recovered rsyslog/TCP session, and fresh post-restart delivery were proven."},{"requirement":"Final end-to-end health and unchanged platform","command_ids":["cmd-941768917735429d","cmd-fcf40ae116934ee3"],"summary":"Both nodes remain on RHEL 9.8 with kernel 5.14.0-687.20.1; rsyslog is enabled and active, forwarding is established, and all three test messages remain persisted."}]}
